### URL: https://www-dev.springfield.moz.works/get/

# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-language-not-available = تہاݙی زبان وچ { $partner } توں ایہ { -brand-name-firefox } ڈاؤن لوڈ دستیاب نہیں۔ تساں ہیٹھ ݙتے ڳئے بٹݨ نال { -brand-name-firefox } ڈاؤن لوڈ کر سڳدے وے۔
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-device-not-available = تہاݙے ڈیوائس واسطے { $partner } توں ایہ { -brand-name-firefox } ڈاؤن لوڈ دستیاب نہیں۔ تساں ہیٹھ ݙتے ڳئے بٹݨ نال { -brand-name-firefox } ڈاؤن لوڈ کر سڳدے وے۔
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-already-using-firefox = تساں پہلے توں { -brand-name-firefox } ورتیندے پئے وے۔ نویں ڳالھیں ویکھݨ واسطے firefox.com تے ونڄو۔
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-continue = firefox.com تے ونڄو
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-link-visit = { $partner } ݙیکھو
